ending all the messages and receiving all the acks. It computes the throughput by: 30 * message_size_in_bytes / total_time_in_seconds and print the throughput value. After that, the client should exit.","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347274},{"name":"maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","owner":"maringantis","html_url":"https://github.com/maringantis/TCP-Socket-data-transfer-no-limit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"TCP socket program with no limit data transfer from client to server.No FILES operations were used.","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347275},{"name":"littlebee/react-focus-trap-amd","owner":"littlebee","html_url":"https://github.com/littlebee/react-focus-trap-amd","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"CoffeeScript","description":"A webpack packaging of react-focus-trap that is compatible with requireJs","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347276},{"name":"cbessee/WP-Recipes","owner":"cbessee","html_url":"https://github.com/cbessee/WP-Recipes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"PHP","description":"A simple wordpress plugin for creating custom recipe post types. Recipes are displayed according to the Schema.org/Recipe model.","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347280},{"name":"Talljoe/oh-my-zsh-plugin","owner":"Talljoe","html_url":"https://github.com/Talljoe/oh-my-zsh-plugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"Plugin for Oh My ZSH, mainly for personal use","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347287},{"name":"muditmittal/Facebook-Photo-Gallery","owner":"muditmittal","html_url":"https://github.com/muditmittal/Facebook-Photo-Gallery","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Swift","description":"Week 5 Assignment","topics":[],"score":190479,"global_rank":347302},{"name":"pfrcks/MovieQuotePlugin","owner":"pfrcks","html_url":"https://github.com/pfrcks/MovieQuotePlugin","stars":0,"